                                <li>Navigate to <a href="chrome://os-settings/crostini">chrome://os-settings/crostini</a>  (Copy/Paste link if blocked)</li>
                                <li>Under "<b>Linux (Beta)</b>" select "Turn On". <i>Default values are fine.</i></li>
                                <li>When the Terminal appears (i.e. black window), Copy/Paste the following command:</li>
